cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GLP-1 PKR Clinical Decision Tool"
abstract: "Interactive clinical decision support tool implementing the GLP-1 PKR framework — GLP-1 receptor agonist–induced pharmacokinetic recalibration of lipophilic psychotropic medications. Computes expected percentage change in steady-state plasma concentration (%ΔCss) for 31 psychotropic medications across 8 GLP-1 receptor agonist regimens and 0–35% body weight loss, with drug-specific QTc, D3-preferential, and TDM actionability flags."
